  locale: en
  entries:
  - key: project.capacity
    text: MAKE ROOM OR UPGRADE CARGO
  - key: project.dismiss-summary
    text: DISMISS SUMMARY
  - key: project.connect
    text: CONNECT LOCAL STORAGE
  - key: common.close
    text: Close
  - key: project.hull
    text: IMPROVE HULL PROTECTION
  - key: project.landing-blocked
    text: Hull protection is required to land here.
  - key: project.travel-cost
    text: 'Trip quote: {0} gal. Review the route on the map before departure.'
  - key: reward.confirm-discard
    text: Tap discard again to permanently give up this saved bonus.
  - key: reward.harvest
    text: 'WATCH AD: +{0} {1}'
  - key: reward.construction
    text: 'WATCH AD: SAVE {0}'
  - key: reward.saved
    text: Ad bonus saved.
  - key: reward.not-earned
    text: No bonus earned. Your normal progress is unchanged.
  - key: reward.changed
    text: This reward is no longer available. Continue normally or check your project.
  - key: reward.restore-busy
    text: Finish or dismiss the pending ad reward before restoring. Saves with an
      unresolved reward cannot be restored.
  - key: reward.space
    text: Make room in cargo, then retry your saved ad bonus.
  - key: reward.save-failed
    text: Reward could not be saved. Do not close the game; retry from your project.
      {0}
  - key: reward.job-changed
    text: That construction job has changed or finished. No other job was boosted.
  - key: reward.timeout
    text: The ad did not finish in time. Continue normally; no bonus was granted.
  - key: reward.failed
    text: The ad was unavailable. Your normal action is still available.
  - key: reward.recovery-earned
    text: An earned ad bonus is saved and waiting. Retry to claim it.
  - key: reward.recovery-pending
    text: An interrupted ad could not be verified. No bonus is assumed; any collected
      base harvest is safe.
  - key: reward.retry
    text: CLAIM SAVED BONUS
  - key: reward.dismiss
    text: DISMISS INTERRUPTED REQUEST
  - key: reward.discard
    text: DISCARD THIS UNCLAIMED BONUS
  - key: project.prerequisite
    text: OPEN REQUIRED RESEARCH
  - key: project.lab
    text: PREPARE A LOCAL LAB
  - key: project.xp
    text: EARN XP FROM WAVES
  - key: project.upgrade-station
    text: UPGRADE THIS STATION
  - key: project.title
    text: TRACKED PROJECT
  - key: project.track
    text: TRACK THIS PROJECT
  - key: project.tracked
    text: Tracking {0}. One project stays with you between sessions.
  - key: project.resume
    text: RESUME PROJECT
  - key: project.open
    text: OPEN
  - key: project.clear
    text: STOP TRACKING
  - key: project.empty
    text: Track an upgrade, recipe or construction from its cost card.
  - key: project.complete
    text: Project complete.
  - key: project.remaining
    text: Gather the remaining materials, then return to finish.
  - key: project.missing
    text: This project is no longer available. Stop tracking it and choose another.
  - key: project.read-only
    text: Tracking cannot be saved while this save is read-only.
  - key: project.save-failed
    text: Project changed, but could not be saved. Keep the game open and retry.
  - key: project.return-world
    text: Return to the project's world. Remote stock is not automatically spendable.
  - key: project.anchor-missing
    text: This structure is no longer here. Open the project or choose another source.
  - key: project.previous
    text: PREVIOUS STEP
  - key: project.return
    text: RETURN TO {0}
  - key: project.depth
    text: Too many ingredient steps. Return to your project or choose another source.
  - key: project.shortfall
    text: 'Need {0} {1}. Usable here: {2}. Still missing: {3}.'
  - key: project.stock-ready
    text: You have enough in cargo and connected local storage.
  - key: project.stored
    text: '{0} {1} stored on {2}, not aboard.'
  - key: project.withdraw
    text: OPEN LOCAL STORAGE
  - key: project.transfer-cost
    text: 'Relay quote: {0} fuel energy. Space and fuel are checked when you transfer.'
  - key: project.open-relay
    text: OPEN RELAY
  - key: project.view-world
    text: CHECK TRAVEL TO THIS WORLD
  - key: project.produce
    text: OPEN LOCAL PRODUCER
  - key: project.build-producer
    text: FIND A LOCAL PRODUCER
  - key: project.find-world
    text: FIND A SUPPLYING WORLD
  - key: project.manual
    text: BROWSE RESOURCE ATLAS
  - key: project.while-away
    text: WHILE YOU WERE AWAY
  - key: project.job-ready
    text: Construction ready on {0}.
  - key: project.output-ready
    text: '{0} {1} produced on {2}. Output remains in local storage.'
  - key: fuel.title
    text: SHIP FUEL TANKS
  - key: fuel.open
    text: FUEL TANKS
  - key: fuel.gallons
    text: '{0} gal'
  - key: fuel.millions
    text: '{0}M gal'
  - key: fuel.billions
    text: '{0}B gal'
  - key: fuel.slot-thousands
    text: '{0}k'
  - key: fuel.summary
    text: '{0} / {1} tank racks occupied'
  - key: fuel.help
    text: Ship fuel is measured in equivalent gallons. Plasma and antimatter hold
      more energy per rack. Refill by crafting fuel or withdrawing from a local Fuel
      Depot.
  - key: fuel.stored
    text: Stored {0:N0} gal in the Fuel Depot.
  - key: fuel.withdrew
    text: Transferred {0:N0} gal to ship tanks.
  - key: fuel.store-empty
    text: No matching ship fuel fits in this depot.
  - key: fuel.withdraw-empty
    text: No matching reserve fuel fits in the ship tanks. Spend fuel or upgrade
      tanks.
  - key: fuel.overflow
    text: Your previous reserves are safe, even above capacity. Burn or store some
      fuel, or upgrade the tanks, before refilling.
  - key: fuel.upgrade
    text: UPGRADE TANKS
  - key: network.title
    text: PLANET NETWORK
  - key: network.help
    text: Build a Warp Gate on each visited world, then permanently link them. Connected
      worlds cost no fuel and have no flight mini-game. Hull protection still applies.
      Solid green map lines show your links.
  - key: network.map.lock
    text: Complete a Warp Gate on this world to use the planet network.
  - key: network.lock.busy
    text: Finish the current journey or resolve the read-only save before changing
      the network.
  - key: network.lock.unavailable
    text: Planet network content is unavailable in this build.
  - key: network.lock.destination
    text: Select another valid world.
  - key: network.lock.connected
    text: These worlds already share a permanent connection.
  - key: network.lock.visit
    text: Visit this world and build its Warp Gate first.
  - key: network.lock.gates
    text: Both worlds need a completed level {0} Warp Gate.
  - key: network.lock.plating
    text: Upgrade your hull protection before landing on this world.
  - key: network.lock.resources
    text: Bring the required resources to this world or its pooled warehouses.
  - key: network.lock.complete
    text: The Grand Archive is already online.
  - key: network.lock.archive
    text: Build a Warp Gate and Cargo Depot on your archive world.
  - key: network.lock.worlds
    text: Link a different supply world for each resource shown above.
  - key: network.lock.warehouses
    text: Dedicate this world to storage with at least {0} warehouses and {1:N0}
      warehouse slots.
  - key: network.link
    text: LINK {0}
  - key: network.linked
    text: '{0} permanently linked. Free network travel is ready.'
  - key: network.link.active
    text: PERMANENT LINK ACTIVE
  - key: network.route.free
    text: Free passage - no fuel, no flight mini-game
  - key: network.travel
    text: GATE TRANSIT
  - key: network.lightspeed
    text: LIGHTSPEED
  - key: network.project.title
    text: THE GRAND ARCHIVE
  - key: network.project.help
    text: Unite five different supply worlds, then build a warehouse world to hold
      the final shipment. Your archive world is the hub, not one of the five suppliers.
  - key: network.world.missing
    text: Supply world needed
  - key: network.find
    text: FIND
  - key: network.archive.status
    text: 'Archive world: {0}/{1} warehouses - {2:N0}/{3:N0} storage slots'
  - key: network.archive.help
    text: Choose a large world. Reserve five pads of capacity for its Warp Gate and
      Cargo Depot, and devote the rest to warehouses. Upgrade them, fill the pooled
      storage, then commission the archive here. This consumes the shipment once.
  - key: network.complete
    text: COMMISSION GRAND ARCHIVE
  - key: network.complete.title
    text: YOUR WORLDS, UNITED
  - key: network.complete.reward
    text: Lightspeed unlocked. Travel instantly to any previously visited world,
      even without a gate link. No fuel. No flight mini-game. Your worlds and progress
      are yours to keep.
  - key: network.destinations
    text: LINK FROM THIS WORLD
  - key: network.destinations.empty
    text: No other visited world has a completed Warp Gate yet. Build one there,
      return here, then link it on the map or in this list.
  - key: network.open-map
    text: OPEN PLANET MAP
  - key: network.replay
    text: REPLAY FINALE
  - key: network.prestige
    text: REVIEW OPTIONAL PRESTIGE
  - key: network.save-failed
    text: 'Could not save the network change. Nothing was spent. Retry after fixing
      storage: {0}'
  - key: network.film.assembly
    text: FROM ONE SMALL WORLD
  - key: network.film.assembly-help
    text: Every harvest, every expedition, every world you returned to brought you
      here.
  - key: network.film.connected
    text: A GALAXY WITHIN REACH
  - key: network.film.connected-help
    text: Five supply worlds. One great archive. Your frontier is finally connected.
  - key: network.film.lightspeed
    text: DISTANCE IS NO LONGER A LIMIT
  - key: network.film.thanks
    text: THANK YOU FOR PLAYING SPHEER
  - key: network.film.thanks-help
    text: Keep exploring with lightspeed, or review a fresh universe with a permanent
      harvest bonus. Prestige is optional and always asks before resetting anything.
  - key: network.keep-playing
    text: KEEP EXPLORING
  - key: resource.find
    text: Find {0}
  - key: tools.mining
    text: MINING
  - key: tools.mining.help
    text: One upgrade improves both vein mining and pressure drilling.
  - key: harvest.vein.title
    text: FOLLOW THE VEIN
  - key: harvest.vein.hint
    text: Steer through bright ore. Hold BRAKE (Space) for time to plan. Three rich
      seams in a row repair the rig.
  - key: harvest.vein.brake
    text: HOLD BRAKE
  - key: harvest.vein.chain
    text: Rich chain {0} - every 3 repairs the rig
  - key: harvest.vein.metric
    text: RICH SEAMS
  - key: harvest.vein.left
    text: LEFT
  - key: harvest.vein.right
    text: RIGHT
  - key: harvest.vein.status
    text: DEPTH {0}/{1}   ORE {2}   HULL {3}
  - key: harvest.vein.steer
    text: Drag to steer, or use the left and right controls.
  - key: world.view.close
    text: SURFACE VIEW
  - key: world.view.orbit
    text: ORBIT VIEW
  - key: world.view.help
    text: Rotate to tap buildings or debris.
  - key: world.site.tool
    text: Ready with {0}
  - key: world.site.gather
    text: GATHER
  - key: world.site.build
    text: Build or finish a matching gather structure to work this resource.
  - key: travel.recovery.cannot-start
    text: Cannot start a journey while another trip is pending or this save is read-only.
  - key: travel.recovery.save-failed
    text: 'Journey progress could not be saved: {0}'
  - key: travel.recovery.invalid
    text: This interrupted journey no longer matches this save or its route.
  - key: travel.recovery.pending-save
    text: Journey progress has not been saved. Keep the game open while saving retries.
  - key: travel.recovery.restore-busy
    text: Finish or discard the interrupted journey before restoring a different
      save. In-flight cloud snapshots cannot be restored in this build.
  - key: travel.recovery.unavailable
    text: The travel recovery provider is unavailable. The saved journey has been
      preserved.
  - key: travel.recovery.incompatible
    text: Saved run data is incompatible or damaged. It has been preserved; no fuel
      charge or trip rewards have been applied.
  - key: travel.recovery.title
    text: INTERRUPTED JOURNEY
  - key: travel.recovery.discard-help
    text: Discard returns you to the departure world without a fuel charge or trip
      rewards. Already used revive shards are not refunded.
  - key: travel.recovery.discard
    text: DISCARD JOURNEY
  - key: travel.recovery.read-only
    text: Returned to the departure world for this read-only session. The saved journey
      on disk is unchanged.
