  - key: guide.research.title
    text: Research your first technology
  - key: guide.research.help
    text: Build a Research Lab on this world, then open Research > Tech. Check each
      technology's XP, lab and material requirements. Research opens new buildings,
      recipes and equipment; upgrade your lab for deeper technology.
  - key: guide.upgrade.title
    text: Buy your first upgrade
  - key: guide.upgrade.help
    text: Open Ship for cargo, tools and systems upgrades, or Research > Improvements
      for global defense and logistics. Harvest and craft what you need, upgrade,
      then explore farther and build another base.
  - key: guide.action.research
    text: OPEN RESEARCH
  - key: guide.action.upgrade
    text: OPEN SHIP UPGRADES
  - key: guide.build.help
    text: Prepare for your first departure. A Lumber Camp supplies wood for your
      first base.
  - key: guide.gather.help
    text: Tap your Lumber Camp, then HARVEST wood. Better timing brings back more
      cargo.
  - key: guide.store.help
    text: Store extra cargo in a Warehouse on this world to make room for your next
      haul.
  - key: guide.craft.help
    text: Turn gathered materials into supplies at a Refinery.
  - key: guide.defend.help
    text: Call a wave from an Alarm when your defenses are ready. Victories earn
      XP for better equipment.
  - key: guide.travel.help
    text: Open the map, choose a reachable world, and spend fuel to land there.
  - key: guide.skip
    text: Skip first-session objectives
