  - key: privacy.title
    text: PRIVACY
  - key: privacy.help
    text: Choices save locally. Online ranks are available to all players who opt
      in. Posting ranks sends Unity an anonymous player identifier and your Frontier
      Score; connecting also exposes normal connection data such as your IP address.
      No public name, email or birthday is requested. Scores upload only when you
      choose to post them. Analytics, ads and cloud saves have separate availability
      and controls.
  - key: privacy.policy
    text: VIEW PRIVACY POLICY
