  - key: privacy.off
    text: OFF
  - key: privacy.saved
    text: Privacy choice saved on this device
  - key: recovery.title
    text: SAVE RECOVERY
  - key: recovery.help
    text: Protect this device's save with Apple Sign-In on iPhone or Google Play
      Games on Android. Signing in never replaces local progress; cloud copies are
      compared and moved only when you choose.
  - key: recovery.enable
    text: Enable online account features above to manage save recovery.
