  - key: deletion.title
    text: ONLINE SAVE & ACCOUNT DELETION
  - key: deletion.help
    text: Delete this signed-in account's Frontier cloud save and online account.
      Local progress and the local restore backup are kept; use Reset Progress separately
      to erase those. This does not claim to remove store purchase history, leaderboard
      or analytics records.
  - key: deletion.unavailable
    text: Online deletion is unavailable until account and cloud-save services are
      configured. No online data has been deleted.
  - key: deletion.sign-in
    text: Sign in to the account you want to delete using Save Recovery above, then
      return here. Deletion never creates or signs in to an account automatically.
  - key: deletion.action
    text: DELETE ONLINE SAVE & ACCOUNT
  - key: deletion.confirm
    text: CONFIRM PERMANENT ONLINE DELETION
  - key: deletion.warning
    text: This cannot be undone. Your Frontier cloud save is removed first; only
      then is the signed-in account deleted. If account deletion fails afterward,
      the cloud save remains deleted and you must retry. Local progress is kept.
  - key: deletion.cancel
    text: CANCEL DELETION
  - key: deletion.busy
    text: DELETING ONLINE SAVE & ACCOUNT...
  - key: deletion.done
    text: Frontier cloud save and online account deleted. Local progress and the
      local restore backup were not changed.
