    text: A grim world of volcanic glass and deep ravines
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.obsidian.3
    text: A dusky world of dark stone and cold lightning
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.shattered.0
    text: A broken world of drifting fragments and open voids
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.shattered.1
    text: A shattered world torn apart by ancient forces
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.shattered.2
    text: A fractured world of floating crags and bright rifts
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.shattered.3
    text: A ruined world split by glowing fault lines
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.desert.0
    text: A scorched world of endless dunes and wind-carved rock
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.desert.1
    text: A sun-baked world of golden sand seas
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.desert.2
    text: A dry world of salt flats and shifting dunes
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.desert.3
    text: An arid world of cracked basins and red mesas
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.oceanic.0
    text: A water world of open seas and scattered islets
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.oceanic.1
    text: An ocean world of rolling swells and floating kelp forests
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.oceanic.2
    text: A blue world of deep seas and tidal archipelagos
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.oceanic.3
    text: A flooded world with only thin ribbons of land
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.gasgiant.0
    text: A towering gas giant of banded clouds and storm vortices
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.gasgiant.1
    text: A vast gas giant wrapped in swirling cloud bands
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.gasgiant.2
    text: A gas giant of churning storm bands
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.gasgiant.3
    text: A hazy gas giant crossed by slow, enormous storms
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.barren.0
    text: A bare, cratered rock with almost no atmosphere
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.barren.1
    text: A lifeless world of dust and impact craters
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.barren.2
    text: A barren world of grey regolith and long shadows
  - key: planet.blurb.opener.barren.3
    text: A silent, airless world of pitted stone
  - key: planet.blurb.belt.0
    text: A drifting belt of rubble and tumbling rock
  - key: planet.blurb.belt.1
    text: A dense ring of asteroids and salvageable wreckage
  - key: planet.blurb.belt.2
    text: A scattered belt of rock and metal debris
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.clear.0
    text: beneath clear skies
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.clear.1
    text: under calm, open skies
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.clear.2
    text: beneath a quiet sky
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.rain.0
    text: under steady rain
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.rain.1
    text: beneath endless grey rain
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.rain.2
    text: lashed by warm rain
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.snow.0
    text: under falling snow
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.snow.1
    text: beneath drifting snowfall
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.snow.2
    text: shrouded in a snowy haze
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.embers.0
    text: under a slow drift of embers
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.embers.1
    text: beneath showers of embers
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.embers.2
    text: with ash and embers on the wind
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.spores.0
    text: wreathed in drifting spores
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.spores.1
    text: under clouds of luminous spores
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.spores.2
    text: with spores hanging in the air
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.dust.0
    text: under dust-laden winds
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.dust.1
    text: beneath a veil of dust
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.dust.2
    text: swept by dry, gritty winds
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.storm.0
    text: wracked by violent storms
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.storm.1
    text: under constant lightning storms
  - key: planet.blurb.sky.storm.2
    text: battered by howling storms
  - key: planet.blurb.size.dwarf.0
    text: Its small size leaves room for only a few structures.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.dwarf.1
    text: A tiny world with tight building room.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.small.0
    text: A compact world with modest building room.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.small.1
    text: Compact, with space for a small outpost.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.medium.0
    text: There is room for a respectable base.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.medium.1
    text: A mid-sized world with decent building room.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.large.0
    text: A large world with plenty of ground to build on.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.large.1
    text: Wide plains and ridges leave generous building room.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.giant.0
    text: A giant world with sprawling building room.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.giant.1
    text: Its sheer size offers sprawling room for bases.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.colossal.0
    text: A colossal world with vast tracts of buildable ground.
  - key: planet.blurb.size.colossal.1
    text: Colossal in scale, with room for a whole network of bases.
  - key: planet.blurb.calm.0
    text: Landing conditions are mild.
  - key: planet.blurb.calm.1
    text: A forgiving place to touch down.
  - key: planet.blurb.calm.2
    text: The ground is stable and the air is kind.
  - key: planet.blurb.opening
    text: '{0} {1}.'
  - key: planet.blurb.opening-no-sky
    text: '{0}.'
  - key: planet.blurb.join
    text: '{0} {1}'
  - key: planet.blurb.rings
    text: Pale rings circle it.
  - key: planet.blurb.moon.one
    text: A single moon circles it.
  - key: planet.blurb.moon.2
    text: Two moons circle it.
  - key: planet.blurb.moon.3
    text: Three moons circle it.
  - key: planet.blurb.moon.4
    text: Four moons circle it.
  - key: planet.blurb.moon.5
    text: Five moons circle it.
  - key: planet.blurb.moon.6
    text: Six moons circle it.
  - key: planet.blurb.moon.7
    text: Seven moons circle it.
  - key: planet.blurb.hazards
    text: Expect {0}.
  - key: planet.blurb.list.more
    text: '{0}, {1}'
  - key: planet.blurb.list.last
    text: '{0} and {1}'
  - key: planet.blurb.hazard.heat
    text: extreme heat
  - key: planet.blurb.hazard.cold
    text: bitter cold
  - key: planet.blurb.hazard.toxic
    text: toxic air
  - key: planet.blurb.hazard.radiation
    text: hard radiation
  - key: planet.blurb.hazard.void
    text: void exposure
  - key: content.resource.wood.name
    text: Wood
  - key: content.resource.wood.description
    text: Timber from the lush worlds, cut green and stacked by the cartload. Every
      settlement begins with it, and every great project comes back to it.
  - key: content.resource.wood.detail
    text: Timber from the lush worlds, cut green and stacked by the cartload. Every
      settlement begins with it, and every great project comes back to it.
  - key: content.resource.stone.name
    text: Stone
  - key: content.resource.stone.description
    text: Dense grey rock that rings when struck. It holds the foundations of everything
      and never runs out.
  - key: content.resource.stone.detail
    text: Dense grey rock that rings when struck. It holds the foundations of everything
      and never runs out.
  - key: content.resource.scrap.name
    text: Scrap
  - key: content.resource.scrap.description
    text: Wreckage and worn-out machinery lie on every world, because someone always
      got there first. Pressed, burned or melted, none of it is ever wasted.
  - key: content.resource.scrap.detail
    text: Wreckage and worn-out machinery lie on every world, because someone always
      got there first. Pressed, burned or melted, none of it is ever wasted.
  - key: content.resource.biomass.name
    text: Biomass
  - key: content.resource.biomass.description
    text: Fast-growing fibrous growth, thick with sap and spores. It ferments into
      clean fuel and weaves into seals that shrug off poison.
  - key: content.resource.biomass.detail
    text: Fast-growing fibrous growth, thick with sap and spores. It ferments into
      clean fuel and weaves into seals that shrug off poison.
  - key: content.resource.iron.name
    text: Iron Ore
  - key: content.resource.iron.description
    text: Rust-red ore heavy with metal, found in veins under volcanic crust and
      dry plains. Smelted, it becomes the skeleton of everything you build.
  - key: content.resource.iron.detail
    text: Rust-red ore heavy with metal, found in veins under volcanic crust and
      dry plains. Smelted, it becomes the skeleton of everything you build.
  - key: content.resource.copper_ore.name
    text: Copper Ore
  - key: content.resource.copper_ore.description
    text: Green-streaked ore that conducts better than anything else you can dig
      up. Drawn into wire, it carries every signal and every current.
  - key: content.resource.copper_ore.detail
    text: Green-streaked ore that conducts better than anything else you can dig
      up. Drawn into wire, it carries every signal and every current.
  - key: content.resource.silica.name
    text: Silica
  - key: content.resource.silica.description
    text: Fine quartz sand from the dry basins and crystal flats. Melted it turns
      to glass, and ground it polishes lenses.
  - key: content.resource.silica.detail
    text: Fine quartz sand from the dry basins and crystal flats. Melted it turns
      to glass, and ground it polishes lenses.
  - key: content.resource.ice.name
    text: Ice
  - key: content.resource.ice.description
    text: Hard blue ice cut from glaciers, comet shells and shadowed craters. It
      holds the cold that cryogenic hulls and quantum lattices depend on.
  - key: content.resource.ice.detail
    text: Hard blue ice cut from glaciers, comet shells and shadowed craters. It
      holds the cold that cryogenic hulls and quantum lattices depend on.
  - key: content.resource.titanium_ore.name
    text: Titanium Ore
  - key: content.resource.titanium_ore.description
    text: Grey ore so dense it blunts ordinary drills. Refined, it turns light, strong
      and unbothered by fire or vacuum.
  - key: content.resource.titanium_ore.detail
    text: Grey ore so dense it blunts ordinary drills. Refined, it turns light, strong
      and unbothered by fire or vacuum.
  - key: content.resource.crystal.name
    text: Crystal
  - key: content.resource.crystal.description
    text: Resonant crystal that hums when struck and glows when worked. It sharpens
      tools, focuses beams and stores more energy than it should.
  - key: content.resource.crystal.detail
    text: Resonant crystal that hums when struck and glows when worked. It sharpens
      tools, focuses beams and stores more energy than it should.
  - key: content.resource.methane.name
    text: Methane
  - key: content.resource.methane.description
    text: Pale gas siphoned from swamps, oceans and giant worlds. A little of it
      burns hotter than a hold full of wood.
  - key: content.resource.methane.detail
    text: Pale gas siphoned from swamps, oceans and giant worlds. A little of it
      burns hotter than a hold full of wood.
  - key: content.resource.helium3.name
    text: Helium-3
  - key: content.resource.helium3.description
    text: A rare light gas drifting in the storm bands of the giants. Ships crave
      it, and so does every quantum machine.
  - key: content.resource.helium3.detail
    text: A rare light gas drifting in the storm bands of the giants. Ships crave
      it, and so does every quantum machine.
  - key: content.resource.core.name
    text: Xeno Core
  - key: content.resource.core.description
    text: A pulsing organic knot torn from alien hives and fallen raiders. Nobody
      agrees what it is, but every advanced machine runs better with one inside.
  - key: content.resource.core.detail
    text: A pulsing organic knot torn from alien hives and fallen raiders. Nobody
      agrees what it is, but every advanced machine runs better with one inside.
  - key: content.resource.radium.name
    text: Radium
  - key: content.resource.radium.description
    text: A faintly glowing salt that ticks in the dark. Dangerous to carry, essential
      for shielding, and priceless to anyone who knows how to contain it.
  - key: content.resource.radium.detail
    text: A faintly glowing salt that ticks in the dark. Dangerous to carry, essential
      for shielding, and priceless to anyone who knows how to contain it.
  - key: content.resource.dark_matter.name
    text: Dark Matter
  - key: content.resource.dark_matter.description
    text: A pocket of nothing that pulls on everything. Dug from the deepest shattered
      worlds, it is the last ingredient of the last machines.
  - key: content.resource.dark_matter.detail
    text: A pocket of nothing that pulls on everything. Dug from the deepest shattered
      worlds, it is the last ingredient of the last machines.
  - key: content.resource.fuel.name
    text: Fuel Cell
  - key: content.resource.fuel.description
    text: 'Compact cells of refined energy that power every jump. Cooked from whatever
      burns: wood in the first days, gas and ice when the ship is bigger.'
  - key: content.resource.fuel.detail
    text: 'Compact cells of refined energy that power every jump. Cooked from whatever
      burns: wood in the first days, gas and ice when the ship is bigger.'
  - key: content.resource.planks.name
    text: Planks
  - key: content.resource.planks.description
    text: Sawn timber cut to length. It frames the buildings of every era, and the
      late projects eat it by the thousand.
  - key: content.resource.planks.detail
    text: Sawn timber cut to length. It frames the buildings of every era, and the
      late projects eat it by the thousand.
  - key: content.resource.iron_plate.name
    text: Iron Plate
  - key: content.resource.iron_plate.description
    text: Rolled sheets of smelted iron, still warm from the foundry. The first real
      building material of any colony.
  - key: content.resource.iron_plate.detail
    text: Rolled sheets of smelted iron, still warm from the foundry. The first real
      building material of any colony.
  - key: content.resource.copper_wire.name
    text: Copper Wire
  - key: content.resource.copper_wire.description
    text: Copper drawn thin and wound on spools. Everything with a pulse, from a
      lamp to a reactor, needs a length of it.
  - key: content.resource.copper_wire.detail
    text: Copper drawn thin and wound on spools. Everything with a pulse, from a
      lamp to a reactor, needs a length of it.
  - key: content.resource.glass.name
    text: Glass
  - key: content.resource.glass.description
    text: Clear, hard panes melted from silica. They keep out the weather, hold the
      vacuum and become lenses when polished.
  - key: content.resource.glass.detail
    text: Clear, hard panes melted from silica. They keep out the weather, hold the
      vacuum and become lenses when polished.
  - key: content.resource.titanium_plate.name
    text: Titanium Plate
  - key: content.resource.titanium_plate.description
    text: Pressed titanium cut into light, stubborn armor panels. It survives heat
      that melts steel and cold that shatters it.
  - key: content.resource.titanium_plate.detail
    text: Pressed titanium cut into light, stubborn armor panels. It survives heat
      that melts steel and cold that shatters it.
  - key: content.resource.steel.name
    text: Steel
  - key: content.resource.steel.description
    text: Iron hardened with the carbon of burnt timber. The backbone of tools, turrets
      and hulls.
  - key: content.resource.steel.detail
    text: Iron hardened with the carbon of burnt timber. The backbone of tools, turrets
      and hulls.
  - key: content.resource.biocomposite.name
    text: Biocomposite
  - key: content.resource.biocomposite.description
    text: Plant fibre pressed with resin into a flexible, self-sealing skin. Toxic
      air eats steel but slides off this.
  - key: content.resource.biocomposite.detail
    text: Plant fibre pressed with resin into a flexible, self-sealing skin. Toxic
      air eats steel but slides off this.
  - key: content.resource.thermal_alloy.name
    text: Thermal Alloy
  - key: content.resource.thermal_alloy.description
    text: Titanium and glass fused into a ceramic-bright metal that glows without
      failing. Hulls plated with it can land where rock still flows.
  - key: content.resource.thermal_alloy.detail
    text: Titanium and glass fused into a ceramic-bright metal that glows without
      failing. Hulls plated with it can land where rock still flows.
  - key: content.resource.cryo_composite.name
    text: Cryo Composite
  - key: content.resource.cryo_composite.description
    text: A foam-cored laminate that keeps its strength far below freezing. It lets
      a ship set down where the air itself is ice.
  - key: content.resource.cryo_composite.detail
    text: A foam-cored laminate that keeps its strength far below freezing. It lets
      a ship set down where the air itself is ice.
  - key: content.resource.rad_shield_alloy.name
    text: Rad-Shield Alloy
  - key: content.resource.rad_shield_alloy.description
    text: Layered steel and radium-laced glass that drinks hard radiation. Shielding
      like this opens the worlds that glow in the dark.
  - key: content.resource.rad_shield_alloy.detail
    text: Layered steel and radium-laced glass that drinks hard radiation. Shielding
      like this opens the worlds that glow in the dark.
  - key: content.resource.void_alloy.name
    text: Void Alloy
  - key: content.resource.void_alloy.description
    text: A black metal grown around a seed of dark matter. It bends light and survives
      where space itself is thin.
  - key: content.resource.void_alloy.detail
    text: A black metal grown around a seed of dark matter. It bends light and survives
      where space itself is thin.
  - key: content.resource.circuit_board.name
    text: Circuit Board
  - key: content.resource.circuit_board.description
    text: Etched copper on a glass-fibre sheet. Every control, sensor and drone starts
      with one.
  - key: content.resource.circuit_board.detail
    text: Etched copper on a glass-fibre sheet. Every control, sensor and drone starts
      with one.
  - key: content.resource.servo_motor.name
    text: Servo Motor
  - key: content.resource.servo_motor.description
    text: A sealed motor with a precision gearhead. It moves every arm, drill carriage
      and turret in the colony.
  - key: content.resource.servo_motor.detail
    text: A sealed motor with a precision gearhead. It moves every arm, drill carriage
      and turret in the colony.
  - key: content.resource.optic_lens.name
    text: Optic Lens
  - key: content.resource.optic_lens.description
    text: A ground and polished lens, flawless enough to focus a laser or read a
      star. Scanners and turrets are blind without it.
  - key: content.resource.optic_lens.detail
    text: A ground and polished lens, flawless enough to focus a laser or read a
      star. Scanners and turrets are blind without it.
  - key: content.resource.quantum_chip.name
    text: Quantum Chip
  - key: content.resource.quantum_chip.description
    text: A lattice of cooled helium and etched crystal that computes in more than
      one state at once. Navigation and research run on it.
  - key: content.resource.quantum_chip.detail
    text: A lattice of cooled helium and etched crystal that computes in more than
      one state at once. Navigation and research run on it.
  - key: content.resource.warp_coil.name
    text: Warp Coil
  - key: content.resource.warp_coil.description
    text: A superconducting coil wound around a speck of dark matter. Charge it and
      space folds; it is the last part of every great ship.
  - key: content.resource.warp_coil.detail
    text: A superconducting coil wound around a speck of dark matter. Charge it and
      space folds; it is the last part of every great ship.
  - key: content.resource.plasma.name
    text: Plasma Cell
  - key: content.resource.plasma.description
    text: A magnetic bottle of superheated gas that carries eight times the energy
      of a fuel cell. It lets a deep run fit in a few slots.
  - key: content.resource.plasma.detail
    text: A magnetic bottle of superheated gas that carries eight times the energy
      of a fuel cell. It lets a deep run fit in a few slots.
  - key: content.resource.antimatter.name
    text: Antimatter Pod
  - key: content.resource.antimatter.description
    text: A pod of trapped antiparticles in a mirrored field. Sixty-four cells of
      energy in a package you can hold, and a carelessness you cannot survive.
  - key: content.resource.antimatter.detail
    text: A pod of trapped antiparticles in a mirrored field. Sixty-four cells of
      energy in a package you can hold, and a carelessness you cannot survive.
  - key: content.structure.lumber.name
    text: Lumber Camp
  - key: content.structure.lumber.description
    text: Tap it to chop the trees on this planet. Higher levels yield more.
  - key: content.structure.mine.name
    text: Mining Rig
  - key: content.structure.mine.description
    text: Tap it to mine stone and ore on this planet. Free to build. Higher levels
      yield more.
  - key: content.structure.driller.name
    text: Deep Driller
  - key: content.structure.driller.description
    text: Tap it to drill ore, crystal and xeno cores. Higher levels yield more.
  - key: content.structure.biodome.name
    text: Biodome Harvester
  - key: content.structure.biodome.description
    text: Tap it to harvest the plant growth on this planet. Higher levels yield
      more.
  - key: content.structure.siphon_rig.name
    text: Gas Siphon Rig
  - key: content.structure.siphon_rig.description
    text: Tap it to siphon gas from the atmosphere. Higher levels yield more.
  - key: content.structure.excavator.name
    text: Excavation Rig
  - key: content.structure.excavator.description
    text: Tap it to excavate buried ice, sand and rare salts. Higher levels yield
      more.
  - key: content.structure.salvage_yard.name
    text: Salvage Yard
  - key: content.structure.salvage_yard.description
    text: Sorts wreckage into scrap and the occasional cache. Higher levels yield
      more.
  - key: content.structure.refinery.name
    text: Refinery
  - key: content.structure.refinery.description
    text: Converts raw materials into fuel and planks. Higher levels unlock better
      recipes and larger craft batches.
  - key: content.structure.fabricator.name
    text: Fabricator
  - key: content.structure.fabricator.description
    text: Draws wire and assembles components. Higher levels unlock better recipes
      and larger craft batches.
  - key: content.structure.foundry.name
    text: Foundry
  - key: content.structure.foundry.description
    text: Smelts ore into plates and alloys. Higher levels unlock tougher alloys
      and larger craft batches.
  - key: content.structure.chem_reactor.name
    text: Chem Reactor
  - key: content.structure.chem_reactor.description
    text: Mixes composites and charges plasma cells.
  - key: content.structure.quantum_lab.name
    text: Quantum Lab
  - key: content.structure.quantum_lab.description
    text: Etches quantum chips and grows void alloy, warp coils and antimatter.
  - key: content.structure.warehouse.name
    text: Warehouse
  - key: content.structure.warehouse.description
    text: Stores resources on this planet. Drag stacks between your backpack and
      storage. The first upgrades add 9 slots each; the late ones add far more.
  - key: content.structure.fuel_depot.name
    text: Fuel Depot
  - key: content.structure.fuel_depot.description
    text: Holds fuel cells, plasma and antimatter in dense racks that do not use
      backpack slots.
  - key: content.structure.cargo_depot.name
    text: Cargo Depot
  - key: content.structure.cargo_depot.description
    text: Pools every warehouse on this planet, so crafting and building draw from
      all of them at once.
  - key: content.structure.orbital_relay.name
    text: Orbital Relay
  - key: content.structure.orbital_relay.description
    text: Withdraw from operational warehouses on visited worlds in this system;
      upgrades extend its beam and reduce transfer energy.
  - key: content.structure.gunner.name
    text: Gunner Turret
  - key: content.structure.gunner.description
    text: Rapid fire kinetic turret. Fires during waves.
  - key: content.structure.laser.name
    text: Laser Turret
  - key: content.structure.laser.description
    text: Slow, heavy beam with long range. Fires during waves.
  - key: content.structure.shield_pylon.name
    text: Shield Pylon
  - key: content.structure.shield_pylon.description
    text: Projects a field that raises reactor health.
  - key: content.structure.missile_silo.name
    text: Missile Silo
  - key: content.structure.missile_silo.description
    text: Launches a splash missile that clears clustered raiders. Fires during waves.
  - key: content.structure.tesla_coil.name
    text: Tesla Coil
  - key: content.structure.tesla_coil.description
    text: Arcs lightning between nearby aliens. Fires during waves.
  - key: content.structure.repair_bay.name
    text: Repair Bay
  - key: content.structure.repair_bay.description
    text: Slowly repairs the reactor during a wave.
  - key: content.structure.alarm.name
    text: Alarm Beacon
  - key: content.structure.alarm.description
    text: Tap it to burn fuel and call a wave. More fuel means a longer fight and
      bigger rewards.
  - key: content.structure.research_lab.name
    text: Research Lab
  - key: content.structure.research_lab.description
    text: Unlocks research. Higher levels open deeper research nodes and tool tiers.
  - key: content.structure.radar_tower.name
    text: Radar Tower
  - key: content.structure.radar_tower.description
    text: 'Extends the survey radius: see more worlds around you before you jump.'
  - key: content.structure.colony_hub.name
    text: Colony Hub
  - key: content.structure.colony_hub.description
    text: Adds builder crews at levels 3 and 7 and discounts planetary obstacle clearance.
  - key: content.structure.hangar.name
    text: Hangar
  - key: content.structure.hangar.description
    text: 'A spaceport hangar: cuts the fuel cost of every trip.'
  - key: content.structure.auto_harvester.name
    text: Auto-Harvester
