  - key: content.obstacle.boulder.name
    text: Boulder
  - key: content.obstacle.boulder.description
    text: A weathered lump of rock sits where a pad should be. Break it up with picks
      and haul the pieces away.
  - key: content.obstacle.dead_tree.name
    text: Dead Tree
  - key: content.obstacle.dead_tree.description
    text: The trunk is long dead and the roots still grip the pad. Fell it, split
      it, and the wood is yours.
  - key: content.obstacle.wreckage.name
    text: Wreckage
  - key: content.obstacle.wreckage.description
    text: Someone else's landing ended here. Cut the hull apart for scrap before
      it blocks anything else.
  - key: content.obstacle.fungal_growth.name
    text: Fungal Growth
  - key: content.obstacle.fungal_growth.description
    text: A shelf of spore-heavy fungus has taken the pad. Burn it back and collect
      what the rot left behind.
  - key: content.obstacle.ice_spire.name
    text: Ice Spire
  - key: content.obstacle.ice_spire.description
    text: A spear of old ice has grown through the pad. Melt it carefully; the water
      is worth keeping.
  - key: content.obstacle.crystal_cluster.name
    text: Crystal Cluster
  - key: content.obstacle.crystal_cluster.description
    text: Raw crystal has burst through the ground. Cut it free before the whole
      pad starts to hum.
  - key: content.obstacle.magma_crust.name
    text: Magma Crust
  - key: content.obstacle.magma_crust.description
    text: A plate of cooled magma has fused over the pad, still ticking as it shrinks.
      Break the crust and clear the slag.
  - key: content.obstacle.void_scar.name
    text: Void Scar
  - key: content.obstacle.void_scar.description
    text: Space itself is torn here. Seal the scar with shielding alloy before it
      spreads under the next pad.
  - key: content.planet.sylva.description
    text: A gentle forest world. Perfect for a first axe swing.
  - key: content.planet.sylva.spot-0
    text: Ironbark Grove
  - key: content.planet.sylva.spot-1
    text: Mossy Outcrop
  - key: content.planet.ferrum.description
    text: Rust-red plains laced with ore veins. Few trees.
  - key: content.planet.ferrum.spot-0
    text: Scrub Trees
  - key: content.planet.ferrum.spot-1
    text: Quarry
  - key: content.planet.ferrum.spot-2
    text: Ore Seam
  - key: content.planet.glacia.description
    text: Frozen world with cryo-vents full of fuel.
  - key: content.planet.glacia.spot-0
    text: Ice Crystals
  - key: content.planet.cinder.description
    text: Volcanic and hostile. Metal-rich, crystal-poor.
  - key: content.planet.cinder.spot-0
    text: Magma Vent
  - key: content.planet.cinder.spot-1
    text: Slag Field
  - key: content.planet.cinder.spot-2
    text: Deep Bore
  - key: content.planet.arbor.description
    text: A planet-sized jungle. Titanic trees, dense crystal roots.
  - key: content.planet.arbor.spot-0
    text: Titan Grove
  - key: content.planet.arbor.spot-1
    text: Root Crystals
  - key: content.planet.nyx.description
    text: A dark hive world. Dangerous, valuable.
  - key: content.planet.nyx.spot-0
    text: Crystal Heart
  - key: content.planet.nyx.spot-1
    text: Hive Breach
  - key: content.planet.nyx.spot-2
    text: Void Ore
  - key: content.planet.aurum.description
    text: Endless golden dunes hiding dense mineral beds.
  - key: content.planet.aurum.spot-0
    text: Dune Quarry
  - key: content.planet.aurum.spot-1
    text: Gilded Seam
  - key: content.planet.tide.description
    text: An ocean world of floating kelp forests and fuel-rich brine.
  - key: content.planet.tide.spot-0
    text: Kelp Forest
  - key: content.planet.zephyr.description
    text: A pastel gas giant with floating platforms in the storm bands.
  - key: content.planet.zephyr.spot-0
    text: Cloud Crystals
  - key: content.planet.pyre.description
    text: A molten shell cracked open by rivers of lava.
  - key: content.planet.pyre.spot-0
    text: Lava Tap
  - key: content.planet.pyre.spot-1
    text: Cinder Vein
  - key: content.planet.halcyon.description
    text: A serene teal ice world, still and deceptively rich.
  - key: content.planet.halcyon.spot-0
    text: Frost Geodes
  - key: content.planet.mire.description
    text: A rotting swamp world. Spore storms and enormous fungal trees.
  - key: content.planet.mire.spot-0
    text: Fungal Giants
  - key: content.planet.mire.spot-1
    text: Husk Nest
  - key: content.planet.obsidian.description
    text: Black glass plains threaded with violet crystal.
  - key: content.planet.obsidian.spot-0
    text: Glass Shelf
  - key: content.planet.obsidian.spot-1
    text: Violet Spires
  - key: content.planet.vesper.description
    text: Twilight world of endless dusk and warring hives.
  - key: content.planet.vesper.spot-0
    text: Dusk Ore
  - key: content.planet.vesper.spot-1
    text: Hive Heart
  - key: content.planet.prism.description
    text: A crystalline world that fractures light into rainbows. Rare.
  - key: content.planet.prism.spot-0
    text: Prism Fields
  - key: content.planet.kaos.description
    text: A shattered world orbiting nothing. The end of the map.
  - key: content.planet.kaos.spot-0
    text: Null Seam
  - key: content.planet.kaos.spot-1
    text: Singular Ore
  - key: content.planet.tundra.description
    text: A windswept frozen steppe on the outer ring.
  - key: content.planet.tundra.spot-0
    text: Frozen Pines
  - key: content.planet.tundra.spot-1
    text: Permafrost Pit
  - key: content.planet.coral.description
    text: A living reef world with bioluminescent forests.
  - key: content.planet.coral.spot-0
    text: Glow Reef
  - key: content.planet.coral.spot-1
    text: Pearl Beds
  - key: content.planet.veridian.description
    text: Lush emerald moon dense with ancient mossy canopy.
  - key: content.planet.veridian.spot-0
    text: Ancient Canopy
  - key: content.planet.veridian.spot-1
    text: River Bed
  - key: content.planet.calcite.description
    text: Chalk-white world with deep stone quarries and iron deposits.
  - key: content.planet.calcite.spot-0
    text: Hematite Ridge
  - key: content.planet.calcite.spot-1
    text: Basalt Quarry
  - key: content.planet.sulfur.description
    text: Yellow brimstone plains erupting with pressurized vapor.
  - key: content.planet.sulfur.spot-0
    text: Molten Lode
  - key: content.planet.magma.description
    text: Churning rivers of liquid rock and rich titanium deposits.
  - key: content.planet.magma.spot-0
    text: Molten Lode
  - key: content.planet.magma.spot-1
    text: Caldera Nexus
  - key: content.planet.lotus.description
    text: Oceanic world of giant bioluminescent floating flora.
  - key: content.planet.lotus.spot-0
    text: Ancient Canopy
  - key: content.planet.lotus.spot-1
    text: River Bed
  - key: content.planet.spore.description
    text: Subterranean fungal hive where massive caps pierce the crust.
  - key: content.planet.spore.spot-0
    text: Titan Fungi
  - key: content.planet.spore.spot-1
    text: Spore Hive
  - key: content.planet.eclipse.description
    text: A dark world locked in permanent transit. Violet lightning storms.
  - key: content.planet.eclipse.spot-0
    text: Black Glass Shelf
  - key: content.planet.eclipse.spot-1
    text: Violet Vein
  - key: content.planet.eclipse.spot-2
    text: Void Rift
  - key: content.planet.phantom.description
    text: Eerie gravitational void world threaded with alien wreckage.
  - key: content.planet.phantom.spot-0
    text: Black Glass Shelf
  - key: content.planet.phantom.spot-1
    text: Violet Vein
  - key: content.planet.phantom.spot-2
    text: Void Rift
  - key: content.planet.borealis.description
    text: Atmosphere glows with shifting auroras above frozen seas.
  - key: content.planet.borealis.spot-0
    text: Frost Geodes
  - key: content.planet.borealis.spot-1
    text: Frozen Timber
  - key: content.planet.cryo.description
    text: Sub-zero glacial rift where geothermal vents spew concentrated fuel.
  - key: content.planet.cryo.spot-0
    text: Frost Geodes
  - key: content.planet.aether.description
    text: Floating crystalline fragments trapped in an ion field.
  - key: content.planet.aether.spot-0
    text: Prismatic Spire
  - key: content.planet.aether.spot-1
    text: Quartz Seam
  - key: content.planet.genesis.description
    text: A primordial anomaly pulsating with raw energy. The deepest world.
  - key: content.planet.genesis.spot-0
    text: Fracture Core
  - key: content.planet.genesis.spot-1
    text: Null Bore
  - key: content.wave-modifier.0.name
    text: Swift
  - key: content.wave-modifier.0.description
    text: Faster approach. Victory rewards +10%.
  - key: content.wave-modifier.1.name
    text: Fortified
  - key: content.wave-modifier.1.description
    text: Tougher aliens. Victory rewards +10%.
  - key: content.wave-modifier.2.name
    text: Overcharged
  - key: content.wave-modifier.2.description
    text: Harder reactor impacts. Victory rewards +10%.
  - key: content.objective.first_structure.title
    text: Make landfall yours
  - key: content.objective.first_structure.description
    text: Complete your first structure. Construction must finish before it counts.
  - key: content.objective.first_harvest.title
    text: First haul
  - key: content.objective.first_harvest.description
    text: Complete and collect a harvest run. Abandoned runs do not count.
  - key: content.objective.first_warehouse.title
    text: Room to grow
  - key: content.objective.first_warehouse.description
    text: Complete a Warehouse to store resources beyond your backpack.
  - key: content.objective.first_fuel.title
    text: Fuel the frontier
  - key: content.objective.first_fuel.description
    text: Craft fuel at a processing station. Found or starting fuel does not count.
  - key: content.objective.first_hop.title
    text: Leave the cradle
  - key: content.objective.first_hop.description
    text: Land on a second distinct world.
  - key: content.objective.first_wave.title
    text: Hold your ground
  - key: content.objective.first_wave.description
    text: Call and clear an alien wave on your planet.
  - key: content.objective.research_lab.title
    text: A place for discovery
  - key: content.objective.research_lab.description
    text: Complete a Research Lab to unlock advanced technology.
  - key: content.objective.jump_range_1.title
    text: A longer reach
  - key: content.objective.jump_range_1.description
    text: Purchase the first Jump Range upgrade to reach more distant worlds.
  - key: content.objective.first_steel.title
    text: Stronger foundations
  - key: content.objective.first_steel.description
    text: Craft steel at a Foundry.
  - key: content.objective.first_hazard_plating.title
    text: Beyond safe skies
  - key: content.objective.first_hazard_plating.description
    text: Purchase any hazard plating to prepare for hostile worlds.
  - key: content.objective.mega_first_stage.title
    text: Think on a planetary scale
  - key: content.objective.mega_first_stage.description
    text: Complete the first stage of a megaproject.
  - key: content.objective.mega_stage_3.title
    text: Megaproject mastery
  - key: content.objective.mega_stage_3.description
    text: Complete stage three of any one megaproject.
  - key: content.objective.era_foothold.title
    text: Foothold
  - key: content.objective.era_foothold.description
    text: Reach the Foothold era by landing on a second world.
  - key: content.objective.era_settlement.title
    text: Settlement
  - key: content.objective.era_settlement.description
    text: Complete a Research Lab and purchase Jump Range level one.
  - key: content.objective.era_industry.title
    text: Industry
  - key: content.objective.era_industry.description
    text: Purchase hazard plating and enter the Industry era.
  - key: content.objective.era_interstellar.title
    text: Interstellar
  - key: content.objective.era_interstellar.description
    text: Purchase Rad-Shield Plating and craft an Antimatter Pod.
  - key: content.objective.era_ascension.title
    text: Ready for the unknown
  - key: content.objective.era_ascension.description
    text: Reach the Ascension era by completing stage three of a megaproject.
