  - key: service.ads.placement
    text: A rewarded-ad placement is required.
  - key: service.ads.unknown
    text: Unknown rewarded-ad placement.
  - key: service.ads.busy
    text: A rewarded ad is already in progress.
  - key: service.ads.disabled
    text: This rewarded-ad placement is disabled.
  - key: service.ads.invalid-time
    text: Rewarded-ad usage or device time is invalid. Retry after the device clock
      is corrected.
  - key: service.ads.limit
    text: The daily limit for this rewarded-ad placement has been reached.
  - key: service.ads.cooldown
    text: This rewarded-ad placement is cooling down.
  - key: service.ads.mismatch
    text: The ad provider returned a different reward placement.
  - key: service.ads.rewound
    text: The device clock moved backwards during the rewarded ad.
  - key: service.purchase.receipt
    text: A purchase product, transaction ID and receipt payload are required.
  - key: service.purchase.busy
    text: A purchase is already being processed. Keep this purchase pending and retry.
  - key: service.purchase.destination
    text: A persistent purchase destination is required.
  - key: service.purchase.verification
    text: 'Purchase verification did not complete: {0}'
  - key: service.purchase.mismatch
    text: The verified purchase does not match the pending store transaction.
  - key: service.purchase.destination-changed
    text: The purchase destination changed. Keep this purchase pending and retry.
  - key: service.purchase.confirmation
    text: The purchase reward is saved, but store confirmation is pending. Retry
      without granting again. {0}
  - key: service.purchase.read-only
    text: Purchases cannot be granted while this save is read-only.
  - key: service.purchase.retry
    text: The purchase destination changed. Retry this pending purchase.
  - key: service.purchase.identity
    text: The verified purchase identity is incomplete.
  - key: service.purchase.journal
    text: The purchase journal is invalid. Store reconciliation is required.
  - key: service.purchase.conflict
    text: The purchase journal conflicts with this transaction. Store reconciliation
      is required.
  - key: service.purchase.rewards
    text: The purchased shard pack has invalid catalog rewards.
  - key: service.purchase.unsupported
    text: This store product has no supported catalog reward.
  - key: service.purchase.wallet-full
    text: The shard wallet is full. Keep the purchase pending until there is room.
  - key: service.purchase.save-failed
    text: The purchase reward was not granted because its save failed. Keep the store
      transaction pending. {0}
  - key: service.analytics.event
    text: An analytics event name is required.
  - key: service.analytics.parameters
    text: Analytics parameters require non-empty keys and values.
  - key: service.leaderboard.request
    text: A leaderboard ID and positive result limit are required.
  - key: service.leaderboard.board
    text: The requested leaderboard does not match the configured board.
  - key: service.leaderboard.limit
    text: Leaderboard page size must be between 1 and {0}.
  - key: service.leaderboard.sign-in
    text: Sign in before loading leaderboard scores.
  - key: service.leaderboard.score
    text: The configured leaderboard contains a score outside the supported integer
      range.
  - key: service.leaderboard.unknown-pilot
    text: Unknown pilot
  - key: service.cloud.payload
    text: A cloud-save payload is required.
  - key: service.cloud.nonempty
    text: A non-empty cloud-save payload is required.
  - key: service.cloud.limit
    text: The cloud-save payload exceeds the 5 MiB limit.
  - key: service.cloud.sign-in-load
    text: Sign in before loading a cloud save.
  - key: service.cloud.sign-in-write
    text: Sign in before writing a cloud save.
  - key: service.cloud.empty
    text: The stored cloud save is empty and cannot be restored.
  - key: service.cloud.changed-account
    text: The signed-in account changed. No cloud save was deleted.
  - key: service.cloud.delete-lock
    text: The cloud save returned no write lock. Nothing was deleted; retry before
      deleting the account.
  - key: service.cloud.replace-lock
    text: A write lock is required to replace an existing cloud save. Reload it before
      retrying.
  - key: service.cloud.missing-lock
    text: Unity Cloud Save did not return a write lock. Reload the save before retrying.
  - key: service.cloud.conflict
    text: The cloud save changed on another device. Reload it before retrying.
  - key: service.recovery.sign-in
    text: Sign in to the current save before linking an account.
  - key: service.recovery.credential
    text: The recovery provider returned an empty credential.
  - key: service.recovery.provider
    text: The configured recovery provider is not supported.
  - key: service.remote.sign-in
    text: Sign in with an existing account before fetching remote configuration.
  - key: service.deletion.busy
    text: Account deletion is already in progress.
  - key: service.deletion.review
    text: The signed-in account changed. Review deletion again.
  - key: service.deletion.changed-account
    text: The signed-in account changed. No account was deleted.
  - key: service.deletion.cloud-only
    text: The cloud save was deleted, but the signed-in account changed. No account
      was deleted.
  - key: service.deletion.partial
    text: The cloud save was deleted, but account deletion failed. Retry account
      deletion. {0}
  - key: service.deletion.unconfirmed
    text: Online deletion failed before cloud-save removal was confirmed. {0}
  - key: service.notifications.busy
    text: Notification synchronization is already pending.
  - key: service.notifications.limit
    text: At most eight crew notifications are supported.
  - key: service.notifications.jobs
    text: Crew notifications must have unique IDs and nonempty text.
  - key: service.notifications.request
    text: Enable notifications again to request device permission when a timer is
      active.
  - key: service.notifications.permission-changed
    text: Notification settings or jobs changed while permission was pending.
  - key: service.notifications.sync-changed
    text: Notification settings or jobs changed during synchronization.
  - key: service.notifications.schedule-changed
    text: Notification settings or jobs changed during scheduling.
  - key: service.notifications.denied
    text: Notification permission was denied. Enable it in device settings to receive
      completion alerts.
  - key: service.notifications.future
    text: A future Frontier crew notification with title and body is required.
  - key: service.notifications.revoked
    text: Device notification permission is no longer granted.
  - key: service.notifications.id
    text: A valid Frontier crew notification ID is required.
