  - key: debug.services.title
    text: Ads & online services
  - key: debug.services.ads-disabled
    text: Gameplay ads remain off pending mixed-age privacy setup and iPhone verification.
      Test diagnostics do not enable live rewards.
  - key: debug.services.ads-unavailable
    text: No ad diagnostics provider is configured for this session.
  - key: debug.services.open-ads
    text: Open LevelPlay test suite
  - key: debug.services.connecting
    text: Connecting to LevelPlay...
  - key: debug.services.opened
    text: Test suite opened. Select Unity Ads > Test > Rewarded. Do not select Live.
  - key: debug.services.failed
    text: The test suite could not open. Check device logs and try again.
  - key: ranks.setup-required
    text: Online rankings could not be configured. Check that this build is linked
      to the Unity cloud project and has its leaderboard ID and HTTPS privacy-policy
      URL. Your local record remains available.
  - key: ranks.read-only
    text: Rankings are read-only. This build does not submit your local score.
  - key: ranks.online.title
    text: ONLINE RANKS
  - key: ranks.opt-in
    text: ENABLE ONLINE RANKS
  - key: ranks.your-rank
    text: 'YOUR RANK: #{0}  -  {1} Frontier Score'
  - key: ranks.diagnostics
    text: Online rankings are enabled. Open Menu > Ranks, opt in, then post your
      score. No age gate or public player name is used. Ads, analytics and cloud
      saves are separate.
  - key: service.leaderboard.submission
    text: A leaderboard ID and a nonnegative integer score no greater than 9,007,199,254,740,991
      are required.
  - key: service.ads.test-editor
    text: The Editor cannot display real iOS ads. Install an iOS Development Build
      on your iPhone to use the LevelPlay test suite.
  - key: service.ads.test-device
    text: LevelPlay tests require an iOS Development Build with test diagnostics
      enabled. Release builds and Android cannot open this suite.
  - key: service.ads.test-ready
    text: Register this iPhone as a LevelPlay test device. In the suite choose Unity
      Ads > Test > Rewarded, not Live. Gameplay ads remain disabled.
